{"reviews":[{"id":"B07B8XCQZW-0","r":5.0,"t":"Better Than a Replacement","x":"I bought this to replace the one I used to straighten my man's hair for years. This one is way better than the previous one. I needed to give it 2 or 3 passes before straightening completely. With this straighter it just needs 1. Definitely worth the price.","h":37,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B07B8XCQZW-1","r":5.0,"t":"Great for natural hair","x":"This product works magic! No more going to the salon to get pressed","h":33,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07B8XCQZW-2","r":5.0,"t":"Best straightener ever!!","x":"My hair is super curly and this straightener made it so easy to fully straighten. Hair stays straight for a week! Amazing product for sure!!","h":28,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07B8XCQZW-3","r":4.0,"t":"No Frizz","x":"It works great on my hair. When the humidity is up even a little bit I usually end up with frizzy hair. This thing keeps it from frizzing, even on the most humid days. I would recommend this product","h":24,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07B8XCQZW-4","r":4.0,"t":"Nice","x":"Works great. I can definitely tell a difference between using this and regular flat iron with out steam. It gets my 4c hair a little more sleek and shiner. However there\u2019s not much visible steam like the picture as I was expecting but I can hear the steam coming out. The only con about this product is the water chamber. It\u2019s kinda small and I had to refill it a few times during the process but it works good.","h":17,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B07B8XCQZW-5","r":5.0,"t":"Good written to detangler hair !!!","x":"The flat iron works well and  straighten your just like you want.i am very happy with it. I had made a  video  but I cannot seen to transfer it over to AMAZON .","h":13,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B07B8XCQZW-6","r":2.0,"t":"This Hair Straightener leaks and is not worth putting water ...","x":"This Hair Straightener leaks and is not worth putting water in it because the water gets all over you and not in your hair.","h":12,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B07B8XCQZW-7","r":3.0,"t":"It straightens, but I wouldn't say it steams.","x":"The straightener comes with a reservoir for water and a convenient dropper for filling, it has a small channel down the middle for the steam to vent out of and allows you to choose how much steam you'd like the come out. The straightener itself heats up quite quickly but the steaming function needs some work.  As you clamp, water sputters out of the holes in the steamer and just spritzes your hair with water leaving some parts damp and others straight. It takes a lot of effort to get any steam b","h":11,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B07B8XCQZW-8","r":1.0,"t":"Don't buy.","x":"The plates do touch one another given even heat on the hair.","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B07B8XCQZW-9","r":5.0,"t":"I think this is the one I've been searching for!","x":"I think this is the one. I've probably purchased at least 15 flat irons in the last 15 years. I've had expensive ones, mid priced ones, steam, tourmaline, ceramic You name it I've tried it. I have thick naturally curly hair. I'm mixed raced, but don't look it. Most stylists don't believe me and don't treat my hair correctly. It's curly, frizzy, thick, and I fear rain and humidity. I live in a very rainy humid region. So far this steam iron leaves my hair soft, shiny, and straight. The humidity i","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B07B8XCQZW-10","r":5.0,"t":"On point","x":"I really love this product. My hair is so moisturized and straight. I have 3c hair. I am very pleased with this product. I got rid of my flat iron. My hair loves the heat but not the frying a flat iron does.  The water chamber easy to use. I would give this as a gift and would recommend to everyone!!","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B07B8XCQZW-11","r":5.0,"t":"Awesome","x":"I used it with a drop of serum mixed with the water in the tank.. couldn't find a product that gives a straight healthy shine like that that lasts ..","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B07B8XCQZW-12","r":4.0,"t":"Well worth the money","x":"My hair is super frizzy, thick, and hard to deal with. The straightener is easy to use and It works instantly. I was sceptical but not anymore!","h":5,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B07B8XCQZW-13","r":5.0,"t":"Good for dry demaged hair","x":"Really, really really awesome product. I have dry demaged hair.This product made them look smooth and soft :) I LOVE IT","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B07B8XCQZW-14","r":4.0,"t":"Steam","x":"Product gets very hot. The lock feature will activate while in use. Annoying but overall good product.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B07B8XCQZW-15","r":3.0,"t":"Get the real version of this","x":"The steam really doesn\u2019t work like it shows in the video or the picture I\u2019m not sure where they got that from but the steam barely comes out and it really didn\u2019t press good.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B07B8XCQZW-16","r":5.0,"t":"I tried to use it on my daughters her hair is nice and soft and silky with one stroke","x":"Great product He does leave my daughter hair soft and silky. I haven\u2019t tried it yet but I\u2019m sure to make my hair just silky.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B07B8XCQZW-17","r":3.0,"t":"Didn\u2019t last","x":"I have only had this for 5 weeks and already the plug for the water chamber won\u2019t stay in place and it leaks","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B07B8XCQZW-18","r":4.0,"t":"Awesome product for the price!","x":"It was a little tricky at first to figure out the water holding cell to steam aspect but eventually I figured it out. However I feel like it runs out of water too fast. Other than that the flatiron works very good. I wish it would of came with a glove because the hair gets very hot and if you catch it to go over a second time you will definitely burn your fingers. I have semi curly-wavy thinning in some areas and thick in other areas hair, and I only had to do a second pass over each piece to ge","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B07B8XCQZW-19","r":2.0,"t":"No thanks","x":"Waste of my money. Yeah it straightens like a regular flat iron. I already have a good working flat iron. Ive seen other steamers that let my style last for days. This didnt do any better than a flat iron.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B07B8XCQZW-20","r":2.0,"t":"No es como la promocionan","x":"No es como lo promocionan en el video, es una plancha para cabellos lisos, si tienes el cabello grueso y ondulado esta no es la plancha correcta para ti.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2022"},{"id":"B07B8XCQZW-21","r":3.0,"t":"It works fine.It doesn\u2019t straighten like on the videos.I will give it another try.","x":"The iron is nice in appearance.It doesn\u2019t straighten hair like the videos show.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B07B8XCQZW-22","r":4.0,"t":"Works great and shipped fast!","x":"Worked pretty good. Left my hair feeling softer after I used it","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B07B8XCQZW-23","r":2.0,"t":"Eh...","x":"Same as the others. Nothing spectacular.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B07B8XCQZW-24","r":5.0,"t":"Amazing","x":"Works great super easy to handle love it","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers with curly, thick, or natural hair say it straightens effectively and leaves hair sleek and shiny.","cites":[2,3,5,10,11,13]},{"text":"Many praise the results, saying hair stays straight and frizz-free, even in humidity, and looks smooth and moisturized.","cites":[3,4,11,12,14]},{"text":"Several reviewers say it works better and faster than their previous flat irons, needing fewer passes.","cites":[1,5,10,13]},{"text":"Some reviewers complain the steam function is disappointing, with little visible steam or water leaking out.","cites":[5,7,8]},{"text":"A few note issues like plates touching or the lock activating during use, though they still find it a good product overall.","cites":[9,15]}]},"qa":[]}